  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "專業實習",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在強化學生專業實務的應用。本課程學生每週至少在實習單位實習4天，並由學生指導教授與實習單位業師共同指導，學生提供工作日誌給指導教授與業師進行督導控管，並返校參加期中座談會、提交成果報告與參加成果發表會。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to intensify students’ ability of the professionally practical application.  Four days per week at least in the internship institution is needed for students enrolled in this class.  Students have to turn in the daily log to their advisors from the university and the institution.  Students also have to attend a mid-term discussion meeting and a final presentation in addition to turning in their final report",
